NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/agent.cappedUnknowns kind=func
  digest=b3:d884ec51454d67f8c7b32880c5601b451ac589be7616e0e65061dcebdaa83a7d file=neo/internal/agent/cassandra.go range=164:179 lang=go exported=false byte_range=7001:7644
  sig=func cappedUnknowns(v *cassandra.Verdict) []string
  doc=cappedUnknowns returns the (capped) list of Cassandra-flagged unknowns for an\naccepted completion. F4: the verification signal is a SEPARATE subtle\naffordance — these caveats ride the cassandra.* side-channel events the UI\nrenders small, and are NEVER folded into the delivered/persisted answer text\n(ux_truth: the user sees the clean result, never the completeness proof).\nReturns nil when there is nothing flagged.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/agent/cassandra.go

