NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/agent.continueFeedback kind=func
  digest=b3:1f1acdb907d1d83342aacc68c2c47a150b60db18c704ff720e040114df35102d file=neo/internal/agent/cassandra.go range=181:200 lang=go exported=false byte_range=7646:8815
  sig=func continueFeedback(v *cassandra.Verdict) string
  doc=continueFeedback turns a not-grounded / incomplete verdict into concrete,\nactionable feedback fed back as the task_complete tool result so the loop\ncontinues productively (advisor-not-effector, i_cass_4). It tells Neo what is\nwrong and what needs fixing — the present-object negative space\n([thesis].mechanism): missing deliverables, unverified claims, open unknowns.
